  o Major bugfixes (threading):
    - Fix race condition where main thread could proceed with cleanup
      before worker threads finished exiting, causing crashes when
      workers tried to acquire already-freed mutexes. Fixes bug 41148;
      bugfix on 0.4.8.18-dev.
    - Pre-initialize RSA and AES OpenSSL providers before spawning
      worker threads to prevent undefined behavior under concurrent
      first-use on OpenSSL 3.x. Fixes bug 41148;
      bugfix on 0.4.8.18-dev.
    - Use atomic operations for thread-safe log severity checking to
      prevent data races when worker threads log during configuration
      changes, and fix dropped early log messages caused by
      uninitialized atomic state. Fixes bug 41148;
      bugfix on 0.4.8.18-dev.
